WEBVTT

00:00:00.830 --> 00:00:04.830
A fire broke out in a midnight express
 earlier today in Hokuriku Tunnel.

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:08.250
The disaster has injured
 more than 700.

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:15.120
After reports from emergency response,
 officials suspect superhumans...

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:18.790
Gosh, they blame superhumans
 for everything!

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:22.120
They know the fire
 was from the smoking room.

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:25.290
Is blaming superhumans
 good for the victims?

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:29.160
Of course not.
 The victims won't come back to life.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:31.420
They're manipulating public opinion.

00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:35.830
The opinion that the government
 should manage superhumans.

00:00:35.870 --> 00:00:39.830
The media will back up our purpose.

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:45.200
Are we creating a society that's
 hard for superhumans to live in?

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:48.200
Don't get all uptight and stiff.

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:52.830
Come on, say something
 to these old geezers, Miss Emi!

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:55.370
Huh? Where is she?

00:00:55.410 --> 00:00:58.500
She left.
 I guess she's seriously worried.

00:00:58.540 --> 00:00:59.450
Worried?

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:04.830
Many of her kin fancy the underground.

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:07.790
Naturally, they will be suspected.

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:15.500
Apollo 17th has succeeded in
 the longest moon landing,

00:01:15.540 --> 00:01:17.410
and they are now
 heading home to Earth.

00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:31.620
Concrete Revolutio
 ~Superhuman Phantasmagoria~

00:01:32.870 --> 00:01:37.910
This world that you couldn't forgive
 is such a beautiful place

00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:43.200
Are you saying everything that
 bears sadness is evil?

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:48.540
Even if the children crumble
 with guns of reality pointed at them

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:50.580
I am me and nothing else

00:01:50.660 --> 00:01:52.580
I gain through gunpoint

00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:57.750
Ready to fight

00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:01.660
I'll rise like the break of dawn

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:04.450
I save them for the final day

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:07.500
Dream of the world
 for me and "fantasia"

00:02:07.540 --> 00:02:09.940
It's time to go
 Unshaken mind

00:02:19.370 --> 00:02:20.540
Change the world

00:02:20.790 --> 00:02:23.080
I shake off my wavering gaze

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:25.910
And find my beloved justice

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:30.950
I live for the tomorrow
 that is unspoken of

00:02:31.370 --> 00:02:33.660
Amidst evanescence and pain

00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:36.660
Only the break of day drives me on

00:02:36.670 --> 00:02:38.840
Until the day
 everything has returned

00:02:39.120 --> 00:02:43.750
I face such horror tonight

00:02:49.040 --> 00:02:51.870
(Devila and Devilo)

00:03:19.290 --> 00:03:20.300
It's me.

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:32.500
Oh my, Ogre Princess,
 pleased to have you.

00:03:33.370 --> 00:03:35.200
Beautiful as ever.

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:39.870
I, Up-Down, am quivering from joy
 to have you ride.

00:03:41.870 --> 00:03:43.250
I'm here for Devila.

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:44.410
What?

00:03:55.620 --> 00:03:57.160
You know where she is?

00:03:57.450 --> 00:04:00.830
No, but if you wish, Princess,

00:04:00.870 --> 00:04:03.910
I shall search even
 the cauldrons in hell.

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:08.540
I hear you curse me out in front of her.

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:10.930
A-Absolutely not!

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:16.860
Freeloader ghost!

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:20.870
Freeloader?
 No, I'm Fuurouta, remember that.

00:04:20.910 --> 00:04:25.120
Ghosts are just lowly beings
 born out of human minds.

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:28.700
Enough! Take me to Devila.

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:29.990
Who?

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:33.330
I wouldn't tell a ghost.
 She ranks much higher.

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:34.660
Higher than me too?

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:37.410
No, Ogre Princess, you're...

00:04:37.450 --> 00:04:40.000
Perhaps the same rank at best?

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:43.760
Take me to her!

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:45.620
I don't have time.

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:48.760
That's freaky.

00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:54.080
Her Majesty was swimming in magma...

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:56.910
I mean, that woman was.

00:04:56.950 --> 00:05:01.160
But after that, Her Majesty...
 I mean, that woman's been gone.

00:05:01.650 --> 00:05:03.910
That's why I'm worried.

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:06.200
She could appear anywhere.

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:08.750
If she fights humans, it's over.

00:05:08.790 --> 00:05:10.910
Devila caused the tunnel fire?

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:14.000
No, she's smarter than that.

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:19.000
But she also has no desire
 to befriend humans like me.

00:05:21.660 --> 00:05:24.080
Deep Underground Method?

00:05:24.200 --> 00:05:25.910
It's extremely deep.

00:05:26.410 --> 00:05:31.000
Unlike the surface,
 the underground is uncharted land.

00:05:31.250 --> 00:05:35.040
Humans will now
 foray into the underground.

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:37.310
But we already have subways.

00:05:37.660 --> 00:05:41.040
Subways just barely
 scratch the surface.

00:05:41.160 --> 00:05:45.080
They'll dig much deeper
 with the Shield Method.

00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:49.450
But isn't that territory
 for Yokai like Miss Emi?

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:53.830
There's an ancient tribe
 that even Emi can't control.

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:57.870
They're more devils than Yokais.

00:05:57.910 --> 00:05:59.330
Are they superhumans?

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:02.000
Legally, yes.

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:04.840
Yokai, devil... No difference.

00:06:05.750 --> 00:06:08.720
So they're within Bureau jurisdiction.

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:13.120
That's easy to say,
 but are they OK with that?

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:15.370
They'd never listen.

00:06:15.910 --> 00:06:18.790
Devila hates humans.

00:06:20.290 --> 00:06:22.950
What kind of power does Devila have?

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:25.620
Ouch!

00:06:25.660 --> 00:06:28.830
How dare you address
 Master Devila like that?

00:06:28.870 --> 00:06:31.410
Of course, you have a high rank...

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:35.120
How deep are we going?

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:41.830
We've arrived at mantle floor 1.

00:06:41.910 --> 00:06:44.200
It's about time.

00:06:46.870 --> 00:06:49.250
This elevator goes sideways?

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:53.000
Ow...

00:06:56.450 --> 00:06:57.790
That burns!

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:03.750
Let's go.

00:07:05.830 --> 00:07:07.370
Another Yokai?

00:07:07.410 --> 00:07:09.330
Cradler, I am.

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:11.910
Water-pressure-proof, I am.

00:07:12.370 --> 00:07:13.410
Full speed.

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:19.450
Searching Master Devila, I am.

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:21.040
Searching.

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:24.580
Cradler, she has
 a younger brother, no?

00:07:24.830 --> 00:07:27.580
Sister Devila. Brother Devilo.

00:07:27.830 --> 00:07:30.330
She absolutely adored him.

00:07:30.450 --> 00:07:32.580
What's Devilo like?

00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:35.180
He's not in adult form yet,

00:07:35.180 --> 00:07:37.410
so he's easier to deal with.

00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:39.410
He's very cute.

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:49.830
There's Tokyo... Shinjuku.

00:07:50.870 --> 00:07:52.950
There's Shinjuku... The east exit.

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:55.120
A celebrity? Model?

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:56.580
What's he saying?

00:07:56.660 --> 00:07:58.200
Such a lovely voice!

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:01.700
There's the plaza.
 If there's a plaza, there's people.

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:06.200
Excuse me, this is not a plaza.
 Please keep moving.

00:08:06.910 --> 00:08:09.450
This is a passage, not a plaza.

00:08:09.870 --> 00:08:12.330
Passages are for walking.

00:08:12.410 --> 00:08:15.410
If there's a passage,
 people cross paths.

00:08:15.450 --> 00:08:17.290
Me, and you as well.

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:18.410
Yes!

00:08:18.700 --> 00:08:20.950
There's heaven and earth.

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:22.730
There's up and down.

00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:25.480
There's left and right.

00:08:25.910 --> 00:08:28.500
Only rights would destroy the heavens.

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:31.410
Only lefts would fracture the earth.

00:08:31.450 --> 00:08:33.540
Both left and right may be.

00:08:33.580 --> 00:08:34.610
Power of words?

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:37.330
Does he chant a spell?

00:08:37.370 --> 00:08:40.870
No, he states
 the ordinary, the obvious.

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:44.040
That is how he moves people.

00:08:47.870 --> 00:08:49.380
(Hawaii)

00:08:51.700 --> 00:08:53.790
There are days when the sun shines.

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:57.200
Days when you get wet from rain.

00:08:57.950 --> 00:09:00.890
Days when the wind brushes your cheek.

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:03.290
And days when storms rage.

00:09:03.500 --> 00:09:05.950
Days when the wind brushes your cheek.

00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:07.870
Days when storms rage.

00:09:07.910 --> 00:09:09.790
And days when storms rage.

00:09:09.830 --> 00:09:11.290
Oh, oops!

00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:16.370
This has the deepest basement.

00:09:16.660 --> 00:09:17.750
Shield Tower.

00:09:17.790 --> 00:09:21.120
The Deep Underground Method building
 Professor mentioned.

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:22.950
I bet Miss Emi went there.

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:25.580
They're remodeling this building.

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:29.790
What's going on?

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:33.120
There's the strong... The weak.

00:09:33.660 --> 00:09:37.620
There's responsible people...
 Careless people.

00:09:37.830 --> 00:09:40.450
The city has many people...

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:43.370
Like how various birds fly the skies.

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:47.270
Like how various flowers
 bloom on land.

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:49.160
There's you.

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:50.580
There's me.

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:53.860
So many people. No two are alike.

00:09:54.620 --> 00:09:57.160
That's why the city is fun.

00:09:58.040 --> 00:09:59.830
What's this? A protest?

00:09:59.870 --> 00:10:02.120
But we never got a notice.

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:04.290
We are different.

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:07.830
Different people gather,
 and that makes the city.

00:10:07.910 --> 00:10:08.870
That's it!

00:10:09.160 --> 00:10:12.880
Different people gather,
 and that makes the city.

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:15.750
This is unannounced.
 Obstruction of traffic!

00:10:15.790 --> 00:10:17.380
I need backup...

00:10:19.160 --> 00:10:20.750
It's a superhuman.

00:10:20.790 --> 00:10:23.290
What? Where?

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:24.410
Him!

00:10:25.370 --> 00:10:27.290
It has to be that boy.

00:10:27.330 --> 00:10:29.160
Different people gather...

00:10:29.580 --> 00:10:32.250
Is it a protest? Maybe a cult?

00:10:32.370 --> 00:10:33.750
Seriously.

00:10:34.660 --> 00:10:36.000
Different countries...

00:10:36.040 --> 00:10:37.790
Did you see that?

00:10:37.910 --> 00:10:41.000
The eye... It blinked!

00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:43.910
What?

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:48.910
Is that a superhuman too?

00:10:49.450 --> 00:10:51.920
I see.
 That's an underground superhuman.

00:10:51.910 --> 00:10:54.200
They caused the tunnel fire.

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:56.290
The tunnel fire... That kid?!

00:10:56.700 --> 00:10:58.750
He finally showed himself.

00:10:58.790 --> 00:11:00.910
Public Security will take over.

00:11:05.620 --> 00:11:08.540
W-Where were they hiding?

00:11:10.040 --> 00:11:12.400
Still searching, I am.

00:11:12.660 --> 00:11:13.750
Searching.

00:11:13.790 --> 00:11:16.750
Don't you have
 other ways of searching?

00:11:16.830 --> 00:11:18.620
Appearance, predictable.

00:11:18.660 --> 00:11:21.750
Sighted near Devilo, 90%.

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:23.410
Then where's Devilo?

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:25.410
Located, I have.

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:28.620
Shinjuku west exit, Devilo is.

00:11:31.160 --> 00:11:35.950
Shinjuku west exit?
 It's like he's asking to be found.

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:37.200
Is Devilo alone?

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:39.040
No, Master Devila...

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:43.040
That woman ordered
 Zumanun to accompany.

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:45.540
Another new guy.

00:11:45.660 --> 00:11:50.620
A hyper-dense hyper-condensed lifeform
 in super-high-pressure underground.

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:52.830
A dumb ghost wouldn't know.

00:11:53.120 --> 00:11:56.450
I do know! A hyper-dense hyper...

00:11:56.500 --> 00:11:57.870
I bit my tongue.

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:01.790
It'll be chaos if
 Zumanun shakes his whiskers.

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:09.910
Everyone makes the city.

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:12.410
The city doesn't make everyone.

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:16.920
People make countries.
 Countries don't make people.

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:21.010
People make countries.
 Countries don't make people.

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:22.050
Stop!

00:12:22.540 --> 00:12:24.050
Snap out of it!

00:12:24.290 --> 00:12:26.330
Look at your feet.

00:12:27.620 --> 00:12:30.200
A monster that roams the underground.

00:12:30.250 --> 00:12:32.310
That caused the tunnel fire!

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:00.700
That way! Get it!

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:01.960
Yes!

00:13:03.250 --> 00:13:06.250
Oh, everyone left.

00:13:08.950 --> 00:13:09.970
Jiro-san?

00:13:10.370 --> 00:13:13.330
He did nothing.
 Neither did his friend.

00:13:13.370 --> 00:13:15.600
It could be a Yokai, or worse.

00:13:16.160 --> 00:13:17.660
Interfering again?

00:13:17.700 --> 00:13:20.290
The Bureau is superhumans' enemy now?

00:13:20.330 --> 00:13:21.980
Superhuman? Me?

00:13:22.250 --> 00:13:24.540
Yeah. What's your name?

00:13:24.580 --> 00:13:26.500
I'm Devilo. And you?

00:13:26.540 --> 00:13:27.490
What?

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:30.990
Introductions are etiquette
 in my world.

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:33.330
Not for humans?

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:36.620
Hyouma Yoshimura.
 Superhuman Bureau. Happy?

00:13:36.950 --> 00:13:38.120
That's perfect.

00:13:38.160 --> 00:13:39.750
Now come with me.

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:40.870
Why?

00:13:40.910 --> 00:13:42.910
The Bureau will manage you.

00:13:42.950 --> 00:13:46.380
There's no need. They'll just use you.

00:13:46.620 --> 00:13:47.910
Come on, Jiro!

00:13:47.950 --> 00:13:50.500
Negotiating with
 Public Security using him?

00:13:50.540 --> 00:13:51.450
No!

00:13:52.410 --> 00:13:56.520
No, that's group hypnosis
 with voice guiding.

00:13:57.040 --> 00:14:00.750
A superhuman power
 like the Pied Piper of Hamelin.

00:14:00.790 --> 00:14:04.200
One can handle human lives
 as if they're lemmings.

00:14:04.250 --> 00:14:06.540
It's a dangerous power.

00:14:07.330 --> 00:14:09.700
You heard it too, Hoshino.

00:14:09.750 --> 00:14:13.120
Yes, but Devilo
 just said normal stuff...

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:14.830
You're so cute.

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:16.120
Hoshinoko, right?

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:18.370
Just some smooth-talker.

00:14:18.410 --> 00:14:20.460
You're cute too.

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:24.370
Come. We can't let
 that power roam free.

00:14:24.410 --> 00:14:28.450
No, go back under.
 Stay out of the human world.

00:14:30.080 --> 00:14:33.910
I like cute people,
 so maybe I'll go with you.

00:14:34.040 --> 00:14:35.250
Umm...

00:14:35.290 --> 00:14:36.870
This is no joke!

00:14:36.910 --> 00:14:38.440
I'm being serious.

00:14:38.790 --> 00:14:39.790
But...

00:14:42.410 --> 00:14:43.400
Darn it.

00:14:45.540 --> 00:14:50.120
You know, it's not good
 to make Zumanun mad.

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:53.080
Attack!

00:14:58.330 --> 00:14:59.500
Alright.

00:15:10.910 --> 00:15:12.160
He'll get hurt.

00:15:12.200 --> 00:15:13.580
We'll get him.

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:20.020
Is it you, mister?
 Wow, don't let go, OK?

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:24.770
He got me!

00:15:24.950 --> 00:15:27.280
He's a quick one.

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:30.490
Meteortail!

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:45.830
Go stop him before the Juniso area.

00:15:45.950 --> 00:15:47.550
Don't do that.

00:15:47.910 --> 00:15:51.630
He's holding back.
 His true powers would be deadly.

00:15:51.910 --> 00:15:53.540
An underground Yokai?

00:15:53.580 --> 00:15:55.370
Yeah, he's a friend.

00:15:55.790 --> 00:15:57.700
Sis told him to protect me.

00:15:57.750 --> 00:15:58.750
Sis?

00:15:59.330 --> 00:16:01.700
Queen Devila of the underground?

00:16:01.750 --> 00:16:04.520
So she is invading the surface.

00:16:04.830 --> 00:16:07.150
Devilo, can we see your sister?

00:16:07.660 --> 00:16:11.490
We'll have Emi put the underground
 and humans at peace.

00:16:11.830 --> 00:16:15.780
Stay out.
 We've decided how to handle this.

00:16:16.500 --> 00:16:20.290
Underground Yokais caused
 a tunnel fire, and as revenge,

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:23.920
Japan will have them
 forfeit the underground.

00:16:24.410 --> 00:16:28.080
We can't have dangerous
 superhumans living under us.

00:16:30.750 --> 00:16:33.910
Look, Zumanun is what's under you.

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:36.410
It's coming.

00:16:36.450 --> 00:16:37.890
- Get the whiskers!
 - Yes!

00:16:38.160 --> 00:16:39.180
Meteortail!

00:16:41.660 --> 00:16:43.020
Stop it!

00:16:43.450 --> 00:16:44.650
Meteor...

00:16:44.950 --> 00:16:46.160
Keep attacking!

00:16:46.200 --> 00:16:47.190
Yes!

00:16:47.410 --> 00:16:48.940
Don't bully Zumanun.

00:16:49.120 --> 00:16:51.160
It's obstructing an official.

00:16:51.200 --> 00:16:52.250
What?

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:57.830
It can transform like a ghost too?

00:16:57.870 --> 00:17:00.040
That's the real ghost.

00:17:04.660 --> 00:17:06.080
- Get him!
 - Yes!

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:19.500
The Bureau and their schemes!
 Where's the real one?

00:17:19.950 --> 00:17:22.600
It's fighting by Koen Bridge.

00:17:22.830 --> 00:17:24.040
Alright, let's go.

00:17:24.870 --> 00:17:26.350
We'll follow too.

00:17:27.700 --> 00:17:29.360
Don't you listen?

00:17:29.750 --> 00:17:31.830
The underground isn't your enemy.

00:17:31.870 --> 00:17:32.950
Quiet!

00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:36.740
They caused the tunnel fire.

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:38.250
Lies!

00:17:39.870 --> 00:17:41.450
Let them back home.

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:43.580
Why do we have to go back home?

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:45.870
We're everywhere...

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:49.660
Our kind is everywhere.

00:17:51.950 --> 00:17:53.330
Take him out...

00:17:54.500 --> 00:17:56.700
Enough! You're going too far.

00:17:56.750 --> 00:17:58.410
Is it alright?

00:17:58.450 --> 00:18:01.080
You don't want trouble
 with Public Security.

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:02.510
Nice, mister.

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:04.770
Darn it! You monster...

00:18:05.660 --> 00:18:07.080
Meteortail!

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:08.540
H-huh?

00:18:09.750 --> 00:18:11.790
Wait, what's going on?

00:18:17.870 --> 00:18:20.530
Oh no. Shield Tower is sinking.

00:18:20.750 --> 00:18:23.790
But this area isn't shaking at all.

00:18:24.410 --> 00:18:26.580
Zumanun dove underground.

00:18:26.700 --> 00:18:28.620
He tolerated so much.

00:18:33.200 --> 00:18:36.700
We scared it away.

00:18:36.750 --> 00:18:38.830
Public Security prevails!

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:41.870
Are you serious?

00:18:41.910 --> 00:18:45.560
His true powers could've
 demolished this place.

00:18:45.790 --> 00:18:48.660
Well, if he's such
 a dangerous monster,

00:18:48.700 --> 00:18:51.190
we'll crack down on the underground.

00:18:52.580 --> 00:18:53.820
Conveniently put.

00:18:54.120 --> 00:18:57.080
First, the kid. You're under arrest.

00:18:57.120 --> 00:18:58.250
Cut it out.

00:18:58.410 --> 00:19:00.540
What if his sister comes?

00:19:00.580 --> 00:19:03.240
That's easy. We'll arrest her too.

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:06.620
Wait, Public Security's
 ignoring the Bureau?

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:10.170
You're just a ministry sub-division.

00:19:10.330 --> 00:19:11.250
Get him!

00:19:11.410 --> 00:19:12.710
Yes!

00:19:18.040 --> 00:19:19.090
What's that?

00:19:25.330 --> 00:19:26.600
Devila!

00:19:29.600 --> 00:19:31.480
You freak!

00:19:49.580 --> 00:19:50.790
What is that?

00:20:04.080 --> 00:20:05.120
Captain!

00:20:05.330 --> 00:20:07.830
The world's water is being sucked up.

00:20:20.120 --> 00:20:22.290
We have no clue what is going on.

00:20:22.330 --> 00:20:26.620
It seems Apollo 17 is
 facing troubles of unknown cause.

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:28.990
I repeat, Apollo 17 is...

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:34.750
Sis!

00:20:50.370 --> 00:20:51.640
A tail?

00:20:51.660 --> 00:20:54.080
Tail? Oh...

00:20:54.580 --> 00:20:57.500
When this grows big
 and I lose my legs,

00:20:57.540 --> 00:20:59.700
I'll become like Sis.

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:06.540
He's so cute.

00:21:06.580 --> 00:21:10.080
I see why Devila came to the city.

00:21:10.410 --> 00:21:13.790
It was until Devilo would
 lose his human form.

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:18.950
So today was like
 a school trip for him?

00:21:24.370 --> 00:21:28.250
If you say we can't live underground,
 we'll live in space.

00:21:28.500 --> 00:21:30.640
We'll create an ocean there.

00:21:31.620 --> 00:21:34.120
We'll go anywhere.

00:21:34.870 --> 00:21:38.120
Nothing is definite.
 It's the same for you all.

00:21:38.330 --> 00:21:40.150
Nothing is definite.

00:21:40.790 --> 00:21:45.200
You and I are different,
 but we can live in the same place.

00:21:45.870 --> 00:21:48.910
I'll head to space before you guys.

00:21:51.120 --> 00:21:54.040
There's the city... And everyone.

00:21:54.790 --> 00:21:57.540
There's him... And her.

00:21:58.040 --> 00:22:00.580
And then, flowers will bloom.

00:22:01.660 --> 00:22:03.950
People can't be birds.

00:22:04.120 --> 00:22:06.250
People can't be flowers.

00:22:06.800 --> 00:22:09.080
People are merely alone.

00:22:09.790 --> 00:22:12.330
But people like birds.

00:22:12.700 --> 00:22:14.580
People like flowers.

00:22:15.120 --> 00:22:17.660
People like people.

00:22:18.370 --> 00:22:21.060
That's the kind of planet that is.

00:22:22.500 --> 00:22:25.200
Wow, how cute!

00:22:34.160 --> 00:22:41.000
In this age where
 ideals are just a fantasy

00:22:41.830 --> 00:22:48.000
Where are you going to
 reach out to?

00:22:48.330 --> 00:22:50.830
Alone by yourself

00:22:50.910 --> 00:22:52.660
Always

00:22:52.830 --> 00:22:54.620
Always

00:22:54.830 --> 00:22:57.790
With somebody's justice

00:22:58.450 --> 00:23:05.750
You're suffering to protect what?

00:23:06.160 --> 00:23:10.250
If you're still captured...

00:23:10.490 --> 00:23:12.080
I can't hold you

00:23:12.160 --> 00:23:16.080
On these streets without any signs...

00:23:16.200 --> 00:23:20.080
A child is crying

00:23:20.330 --> 00:23:27.250
Ideals are just a toy, anyway

00:23:27.510 --> 00:23:34.750
But you still reach out your hands

00:23:35.370 --> 00:23:42.250
Righteous heroes are probably
 just beyond your reach

00:23:43.040 --> 00:23:48.750
I don't mind
 I just want to keep watching...

00:23:49.750 --> 00:23:53.620
Just that one person

00:23:56.830 --> 00:24:00.250
Ichiyu Wakamura, born in Aomori,
 the 20th of Shinka Era.

00:24:00.290 --> 00:24:04.620
I work at a Teito Publishing affiliate
 and live with my 3-year-old Yuko.

00:24:04.660 --> 00:24:07.910
It's a 50-minute commute to my office.

00:24:07.950 --> 00:24:10.830
In between doing chores and work,
 I am Human-man.
